{"parse":{"title":"獨自","pageid":879476,"revid":1528692,"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"zh\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"headerContainer\">\n<table style=\"width:100%; margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:3px;border:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#93A6C0); background-color: var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#F9F9F9); color: inherit; text-align: center; text-wrap: balance;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:0; text-align:left; font-size:small;\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%; text-align:left; font-size:small;\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:50%;\"><b>獨自</b><br /><span style=\"color:var(--color-placeholder,#999999)\">作者：</span><a href=\"/wiki/Author:%E6%9C%B1%E8%87%AA%E6%B8%85\" title=\"Author:朱自清\">朱自清</a><br /><span style=\"color:var(--color-placeholder,#999999)\">1922年2月22日</span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width:25%; text-align:right; font-size:small;\">\n</td>\n<td class=\"noprint\" style=\"width:0; text-align:right; font-size:small;\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table style=\"width:100%; background:var(--background-color-progressive-subtle,#F8FCFF); color: inherit;font-size:small; border-bottom:1px solid var(--border-color-content-added,#93A6C0)\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"font-size:0.9em; text-align:left; background:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#F9F9F9); float:right;color: inherit;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"color: var(--color-placeholder,#999999);\">本作品收錄於《<b><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%E8%AF%97_(%E6%9C%88%E5%88%8A)&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"诗 (月刊)（页面不存在）\">诗 (月刊)</a></b>》\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n发表于1922年《诗》第1卷第3期第51页<ul id=\"plainSister\" style=\"display:inline-block; font-size:93%; line-height:normal; list-style-type:none; list-style-image:none; list-style-position:outside; border:1px solid var(--border-color-base,#AAA); float:right; clear:right; margin:0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex 0.5ex; padding:0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex 0.0ex; background-color:var(--background-color-base,#FFFFFF);color: inherit;\"><li class=\"noprint sisitem\"><span class=\"sisicon\" style=\"padding-right:1ex;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix\" title=\"Special:SiteMatrix\"><img alt=\"姊妹计划\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/20px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/81/Wikimedia-logo.svg/40px-Wikimedia-logo.svg.png?utm_source=zh.wikisource.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1024\" data-file-height=\"1024\" /></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Special:SiteMatrix\" title=\"Special:SiteMatrix\">姊妹计划</a>: <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q85678808\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"d:Q85678808\">数据项</a></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>白雲漫了太陽；\n</p><p>青山環擁着正睡底時候，\n</p><p>牛乳般霧露遮遮掩掩，\n</p><p>像輕紗似的，\n</p><p>冪了新嫁娘底面。\n</p><p>　　默然在窗兒口，\n</p><p>上不見隻鳥兒，\n</p><p>下不見個影兒；\n</p><p>祇剩飄飄的清風，\n</p><p>祇剩悠悠的遠鐘。\n</p><p>眼底是靡人間了，\n</p><p>耳根是靡人間了；\n</p><p>故鄉的她，獨靈跡似的，\n</p><p>驀驀然湧上我的心頭來了！\n</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: center; float: right; margin: 2em 4em 0 0;\">\n<p>二二，二，二二，台州。\n</p>\n</div><p><br style=\"clear: both;\" />\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r4375040\">.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer{box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:1em;margin-bottom:0.25em;clear:both;width:auto;page-break-before:always;break-before:page}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type{display:table;border:2px solid var(--border-subtle,#8888aa);border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0 0;empty-cells:hide;box-sizing:border-box;margin:0 auto 0 auto;width:100%;background-color:var(--background-color-neutral-subtle,#f7f8ff);color:var(--color-base,#202122)}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>div:first-of-type>div:first-child{display:table-row-group}.mw-parser-output .licenseContainer>